 "_readme": "8VC's own /advisors/ page as captured 2016-06-27 (web.archive.org/web/20160627205952). In the 2015-2021 WordPress era the ADVISOR PROFILES lived under /team/<slug> alongside the firm's own partners, so the roster CDX sweep picked them up and the Form D sweep was seeding on Scott Cook, Jerry Yang, John Mack, Ashton Kutcher and the rest -- the COLLECTION.md First Round trap (a people namespace that also holds outside people, each of whom is a related person on their OWN company's Form D). This page is the discriminator: it names every advisor with their role and company. Read the other way round it is also a first-party company list, and is used as corroboration only -- an advisor's employer is not thereby a portfolio company (Intuit, Yahoo!, Morgan Stanley, Box).",
